{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "df2fc390a9b3b96f4f366761c5152cf9fa7dee818d6283313fd1c4a6cc611d68", "ja": "うう～ん……。", "zh": "唔唔～嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e258308f48014812153b2a4a8aa3a571c544eaebba0448ac9c019ba92b8d13a6", "ja": "どうした紗代子、さっきから行ったり来たりして。\n何か気になることでもあるのか？", "zh": "怎么啦，纱代子？从刚才开始就一直走来走去的。\n在担心什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "c63d0cea87805d7990b499a26a16303e5fd2f859137a6329e85d0c8f784e6105", "ja": "{$P$}。あの……この前の\nPV撮影のこと、覚えてますか？　夕焼けの……。", "zh": "{$P$}……你记得之前\n拍摄PV时的事吗？就是夕阳下的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "37e2c242f6c1a3d80bf369838901c97c9e67cb177883cd1222f8b5b7ffe4738b", "ja": "夕暮れの中で、自分の曲を歌ったんだったな。\n一発OKで、みんな度肝を抜かれてたよ。", "zh": "你在夕阳下唱了自己的歌对吧。\n那时你只拍一次就OK，大家都很吃惊喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "40c58437fff1274e96250d804927c453d8d9f8c90d60a0dbbd8f0be4fbc052ce", "ja": "夕焼けの撮影って、時間との戦いだし……\n空模様にも気を遣いますよね。", "zh": "毕竟在夕阳下拍摄时必须跟时间赛跑……\n而且也得注意天空的状况，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "6ffb33093b6f3f921ddea810c02433a072f55872f40d13ee3bd2d4872b81bc4c", "ja": "だから私、ロケ現場に似た景色の場所を探して、ずっと\n練習してたんです。絶対に失敗したくなくて……。", "zh": "所以我找了跟外景现场很像的地方，练习了很久。\n因为我绝对不想失败……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1006_p", "source_sha256": "04e4ae2ead2fcb7433804fa6bc5b6b464df10ffa0f442e228b26bb51b11a0ad7", "ja": "レッスン以外にも、そんな努力をしてたのか……。\nでもその成果は、バッチリ出ていたと思うよ。", "zh": "原来你在训练课程外还做了如此努力……\n但我想那份成果确实有展现出来喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "2b9cf71ae32b60a0ffbd45b5b81af2fbf59a22a6dc9e9712c1abbf15a141d7c2", "ja": "自分でも、やってよかったと思います。\nでも、その時の気持ちが、まだ残ってるみたいで……。", "zh": "我自己也觉得有这么做真是太好了。\n不过那时的感受似乎还留在我心中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "b59492d3289628349292f4fea5bdac21eac61c83cc42176a4922ed1626381c7c", "ja": "こうして夕暮れの時間になると、\nあの時の緊張が、ぶり返してきちゃうみたいなんです。", "zh": "每到夕阳时分，\n当时的紧张就好像又回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "c670c5aa29ff99cb784a3fc5c45cf358f5c3e428ac3e7bd89b4d738c4286403b", "ja": "なんだか、胸の奥がドキドキして……\nいつまでも心が、落ち着かないような……。", "zh": "总觉得胸口悸动不已……\n内心总是静不下来的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f3b22ce24007826509710cb7e21e56ce7fb99f4b1eb282ace341efffa047ac0e", "ja": "それは緊張じゃなくて、高揚じゃないか？\n嬉しかったとか、そういう気持ちだと思うよ。", "zh": "那不是紧张，而是情绪高昂吧？\n我想应该是「当时真开心」之类的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "bb547eedd0530f7f20b4342f9f10f79e5b009cb7cdd784500ce8d373f99c1aa3", "ja": "高揚……そ、そうかもしれません……。\nこの気持ち……そっか……。", "zh": "情绪高昂……或、或许是这样没错……\n这种心情……原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "f0e88acd787965bba197c44fe0841d128e1bfdaa2aa43e87c2142b98fc57a03d", "ja": "私……嬉しくて、そわそわしてたんですね。\n努力が実った、あの瞬間のことを思い出して……。", "zh": "我……是因为很高兴才静不下来啊。\n因为想起了努力得到回报的那个瞬间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "fab4b0b88a1d6a67b3fdc942556dd25d707ba1abee40e22728282a8141202ce6", "ja": "{$P$}。\n気づかせてくれて、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}，\n谢谢你让我察觉这点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0023_1014_p", "source_sha256": "36b28ac72f397c97f976de5d3f1c56ad68222982c8ca34688493ad8c19c9c20d", "ja": "不器用なところは、紗代子らしいけど……\n自主練習も、ほどほどにな？", "zh": "虽然这份笨拙的努力也很符合纱代子的风格……\n但自主练习也得适可而止喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
